<p>The New York Historical holds several other collections related to Penn Station, including <extref xlink:actuate="onRequest" xlink:href="https://findingaids.library.nyu.edu/nyhs/pr042_mckim_mead_white/">McKim Mead and White Architectural Records (PR 42)</extref>, <extref xlink:actuate="onRequest" xlink:href="https://findingaids.library.nyu.edu/nyhs/pr048_alexander_hatos/">Alexander Hatos Photograph Collection (PR 48)</extref>, <extref xlink:actuate="onRequest" xlink:href="https://findingaids.library.nyu.edu/nyhs/pr024_george_hall_son/">George P. Hall and Son Photograph Collection (PR 24)</extref>, the <extref xlink:actuate="onRequest" xlink:href="https://findingaids.library.nyu.edu/nyhs/pr008_robert_bracklow/">Robert L. Bracklow Photograph Collection (PR 8)</extref>, the <extref xlink:actuate="onRequest" xlink:href="https://findingaids.library.nyu.edu/nyhs/pr472_stonehill/">Bob Stonehill Collection of New York City Postcards (PR 472)</extref>, the <extref xlink:actuate="onRequest" xlink:href="https://findingaids.library.nyu.edu/nyhs/pr020_geographic_images/">Geographic Images Collection (PR 20)</extref>, the <extref xlink:actuate="onRequest" xlink:href="https://findingaids.library.nyu.edu/nyhs/pr054_postcard/">Postcard Collection (PR 54)</extref>, the <extref xlink:actuate="onRequest" xlink:href= "https://findingaids.library.nyu.edu/nyhs/pr055_poster_collection/">Poster Collection (PR 55)</extref> the <extref xlink:actuate="onRequest" xlink:href="https://findingaids.library.nyu.edu/nyhs/pr050_photographer_file/">Photographer File (PR 50)</extref>, the <extref xlink:actuate="onRequest" xlink:href= "https://findingaids.library.nyu.edu/nyhs/pr009_irving_browning_photos/">Irving Browning Photograph Collection (PR 9)</extref>, and the <extref xlink:actuate="onRequest" xlink:href="https://findingaids.library.nyu.edu/nyhs/pr181_william_roege/">William J. Roege Photograph Collection (PR 181)</extref>.</p>  </otherfindaid>
