  <dsc><c id="aspace_bde7fcd9c6b169adbdb92a935cebf779" level="item"><did><unittitle>Penn Station: Concourse</unittitle><unitid type="aspace_uri">/repositories/2/archival_objects/316806</unitid><unitdate datechar="creation" type="inclusive">ca. 1963</unitdate><container id="aspace_5bc6c633dedbf04a45d1246d08eea7e0" label="Graphic Materials" type="Box">1</container><container id="aspace_f0c2aec9b6de0fc93f3400af1fbd405f" parent="aspace_5bc6c633dedbf04a45d1246d08eea7e0" type="Folder">1</container></did><odd id="aspace_77482326cb4fd44eb6e5c54b9dd69c7e"><head>General</head><p>Note on verso: "The original Ektachrome film on which the scan was made in May, 2024 was so degraded that I mistook it for a color negative. Restored it produced an o.k. color scan which I reworked in B+W to produce the incredibly sharp print you see here. Perhaps the best photograph I ever took of the Main Concourse." N.M.G.</p></odd></c><c id="aspace_3f722f68ee3116f1ccaaf985dc5899d6" level="item"><did><unittitle>Penn Station: The Concourse, Few signs of impending doom in this view looking north</unittitle><unitid type="aspace_uri">/repositories/2/archival_objects/316807</unitid><unitdate datechar="creation" type="inclusive">ca. 1963</unitdate><container id="aspace_319acda1db93bdfafe91615305a085ff" label="Graphic Materials" type="Box">1</container><container id="aspace_97f0fa66de80123aa807091a413158ba" parent="aspace_319acda1db93bdfafe91615305a085ff" type="Folder">1</container></did><odd id="aspace_e4d86607d19183e28d544e32c5fbbcc9"><head>General</head><p>Note on verso: "The original of this view was 120 Ektachrome that was so degraded (orange color) that I mistook it for negative film and decided not to print it. However with care and restoration this print was possible. Converted to black and white was spectacular." N.M.G.</p></odd></c><c id="aspace_d6edb2758a785446efa00c54cadeb4be" level="item"><did><unittitle>Penn Station: 7th Avenue Facade</unittitle><unitid type="aspace_uri">/repositories/2/archival_objects/316808</unitid><unitdate datechar="creation" type="inclusive">ca. 1964-1965</unitdate><container id="aspace_3eec314feb142fa0bac7c07f3124cbbe" label="Graphic Materials" type="Box">1</container><container id="aspace_f3e73860f4c017951fbd4fef6e932faa" parent="aspace_3eec314feb142fa0bac7c07f3124cbbe" type="Folder">1</container></did></c><c id="aspace_2ec93759e7da0e78d9285e13b1e773c8" level="item"><did><unittitle>Penn Station: Early view from Waiting Hall roof of the Concourse roof looking west with the Hudson River beyond (and N.J.)</unittitle><unitid type="aspace_uri">/repositories/2/archival_objects/316809</unitid><unitdate datechar="creation" type="inclusive">ca. 1963</unitdate><container id="aspace_7f7c0fc395102bfab872764f65779ef2" label="Graphic Materials" type="Box">1</container><container id="aspace_8a6c1a59efec418cc47e0a92442381b9" parent="aspace_7f7c0fc395102bfab872764f65779ef2" type="Folder">1</container></did><odd id="aspace_0be06b4fd423dfd5419d3340041a33ed"><head>General</head><p>Note on verso: "This marvelous roof structure was largely unseen outside except from a high vantage point in the right place. This view from the roof of the Waiting Hall west to the current location of Hudson Yards + Moynihan." N.M.G.</p></odd></c><c id="aspace_1164f7048327ef417ce02308f163485e" level="item"><did><unittitle>Penn Station: Main Entrance on 7th Avenue</unittitle><unitid type="aspace_uri">/repositories/2/archival_objects/316810</unitid><unitdate datechar="creation" type="inclusive">ca. 1963</unitdate><container id="aspace_039c1266b24201b1999f11beaa966548" label="Graphic Materials" type="Box">1</container><container id="aspace_2e700a3ef0f89bae6cbd3911aedff01d" parent="aspace_039c1266b24201b1999f11beaa966548" type="Folder">1</container></did><odd id="aspace_de811095b3377ccb60894de845b1012b"><head>General</head><p>Note on verso: "This elevation of the east facade of Penn Station represents the widest angle view possible of the main entrance at that time."</p></odd></c><c id="aspace_390dd1b71e7041adcaf8a7b8e951a80b" level="item"><did><unittitle>Penn Station Exhibit 2024: The Concourse looking south</unittitle><unitid type="aspace_uri">/repositories/2/archival_objects/316811</unitid><unitdate datechar="creation" type="inclusive">December, 1964</unitdate><container id="aspace_1adcc5eb2c22cc07dc9f83cba7f38bee" label="Graphic Materials" type="Box">1</container><container id="aspace_907b59fea5af10fdc10ccfaffcb2e0e8" parent="aspace_1adcc5eb2c22cc07dc9f83cba7f38bee" type="Folder">1</container></did></c><c id="aspace_5232debccaa5b968813731c23925ad71" level="item"><did><unittitle>Penn Station Waiting Hall Ceiling (end section)</unittitle><unitid type="aspace_uri">/repositories/2/archival_objects/316812</unitid><unitdate datechar="creation" type="inclusive">ca. 1963</unitdate><container id="aspace_40933d4c91b2833070b33c006df9bbf6" label="Graphic Materials" type="Box">1</container><container id="aspace_2adaa90b15f796bee63c1a5326907c35" parent="aspace_40933d4c91b2833070b33c006df9bbf6" type="Folder">1</container></did></c><c id="aspace_bada2632d809eb7f2f3f04708adbcae1" level="item"><did><unittitle>Penn Station: Waiting Hall looking north</unittitle><unitid type="aspace_uri">/repositories/2/archival_objects/316813</unitid><unitdate datechar="creation" type="inclusive">ca. 1963</unitdate><container id="aspace_ff05e1a1f5b8caad48e89c2ceb42d046" label="Graphic Materials" type="Box">1</container><container id="aspace_68a26f649acc653fc11137fe5549d244" parent="aspace_ff05e1a1f5b8caad48e89c2ceb42d046" type="Folder">1</container></did></c><c id="aspace_719f77a40bee4eff9195c5efc87540f2" level="item"><did><unittitle>Penn Station: Waiting Hall from street level looking north, "modern" ticket counter at left</unittitle><unitid type="aspace_uri">/repositories/2/archival_objects/316814</unitid><unitdate datechar="creation" type="inclusive">ca. 1963</unitdate><container id="aspace_d794dae9ba3639e60343d708f2d9ddbd" label="Graphic Materials" type="Box">1</container><container id="aspace_44e3ec19ba4bd63301d9eee7d8fe9721" parent="aspace_d794dae9ba3639e60343d708f2d9ddbd" type="Folder">1</container></did><odd id="aspace_d89bc1185d6e7e043c2342491f916f2c"><head>General</head><p>Note on verso: "Original film was so contrasty it was unprintable at the time. Only much later was it possible with the aid of Photoshop and HDR (High Dynamic Range) to produce a usable scan. That was around 2017." N.M.G.</p></odd></c><c id="aspace_73f9cfb47a79cf1dd4a820b69a127a67" level="item"><did><unittitle>Penn Station: The Arcade, between 7th Avenue and the Waiting Hall on the axis of 32nd Street</unittitle><unitid type="aspace_uri">/repositories/2/archival_objects/316815</unitid><unitdate datechar="creation" type="inclusive">ca. 1963</unitdate><container id="aspace_eb6ad7aede2ec9edc0d25683f1c34db9" label="Graphic Materials" type="Box">1</container><container id="aspace_89af1eeb14ce764dff7382895d7ee5eb" parent="aspace_eb6ad7aede2ec9edc0d25683f1c34db9" type="Folder">1</container></did><odd id="aspace_6bd469759f5a2a829a5c1e3a33d72eaa"><head>General</head><p>Note on verso: "If you look closely you will see a 1964 Dodge car on display. An ironic touch." N.M.G.</p></odd></c><c id="aspace_feeb41337dc8ecdfed051291e2213a99" level="item"><did><unittitle>Penn Station</unittitle><unitid type="aspace_uri">/repositories/2/archival_objects/316816</unitid><unitdate datechar="creation" type="inclusive">ca. 1963</unitdate><container id="aspace_3f35bea33deeebeb24134f1f6eb00b85" label="Graphic Materials" type="Box">1</container><container id="aspace_6150aa1e2f71a917ff24747ac431827d" parent="aspace_3f35bea33deeebeb24134f1f6eb00b85" type="Folder">2</container></did></c><c id="aspace_2b477ecd7dd349a4b061fef4dba18e14" level="item"><did><unittitle>Penn Station: Street level view from 31st Street and 8th Avenue</unittitle><unitid type="aspace_uri">/repositories/2/archival_objects/316817</unitid><unitdate datechar="creation" type="inclusive">ca. 1963</unitdate><container id="aspace_7c565ddac84f43b6f8749814756071c8" label="Graphic Materials" type="Box">1</container><container id="aspace_2cc06b1c53d4cf460f2ba011baa4fccd" parent="aspace_7c565ddac84f43b6f8749814756071c8" type="Folder">2</container></did><odd id="aspace_afc3a39d2da11d417afa635d512bd475"><head>General</head><p>Note on verso: "The south end of the Waiting Hall is the only essential element of the station visible behind the concealing facade. No exterior signage whatever." N.M.G.</p></odd></c><c id="aspace_19ae729f454b57298abe263b140d4d9a" level="item"><did><unittitle>Penn Station: the Waiting Hall looking south</unittitle><unitid type="aspace_uri">/repositories/2/archival_objects/316818</unitid><unitdate datechar="creation" type="inclusive">ca. 1963</unitdate><container id="aspace_943aad1d41f4f7832a80700d035226b0" label="Graphic Materials" type="Box">1</container><container id="aspace_6a4e04a893e2c249c69c18bd282bcf04" parent="aspace_943aad1d41f4f7832a80700d035226b0" type="Folder">2</container></did></c><c id="aspace_397e174595310b3645c8f90c1595ed05" level="item"><did><unittitle>Penn Station: West entrace on Eighth Avenue</unittitle><unitid type="aspace_uri">/repositories/2/archival_objects/316819</unitid><unitdate datechar="creation" type="inclusive">ca. 1963</unitdate><container id="aspace_d07a62af6ac7a9970924b229adef16fa" label="Graphic Materials" type="Box">1</container><container id="aspace_2fe577c43fd3afdb0415db451d486a0d" parent="aspace_d07a62af6ac7a9970924b229adef16fa" type="Folder">2</container></did></c><c id="aspace_2209be3031e8ce7ce4e8ed66af8418db" level="item"><did><unittitle>Penn Station: the Waiting Hall is gone but the Concourse remains</unittitle><unitid type="aspace_uri">/repositories/2/archival_objects/316820</unitid><unitdate datechar="creation" type="inclusive">ca. 1964</unitdate><container id="aspace_a4010fb3d09528d4a7c79c8fab42f5f9" label="Graphic Materials" type="Box">1</container><container id="aspace_7361edca09c0cd02761865942df6115b" parent="asp